  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "让所有人一起动手烧烤。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/3b/18/3b18f4917e68f12e709ed1c38f404ebf.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/3b/18/3b18f4917e68f12e709ed1c38f404ebf.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<h3>厨师永远不嫌多</h3><p>让所有人在烧烤派对上一起烹饪。能让你感觉温暖，充满乐趣！客人到来时，不要为没有准备好一切而有压力。烧烤本身就是公共活动，所以让烹饪成为派对活动的一部分。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "在社交媒体上分享派对照片。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/b4/ef/b4efb8f00d89e9e2e53fedbb25260bc2.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/b4/ef/b4efb8f00d89e9e2e53fedbb25260bc2.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<h3>分享记忆</h3><p>举办真正意义的社交派对，为你的活动创建话题标签，方便所有客人在网上相互分享照片。你甚至可以通过社交媒体在照片上对客人进行标记，<br />以发出下一次派对邀请。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "布置放松随意的餐桌。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/8e/b1/8eb119a8d1fec73e23474c1af9c7d82e.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/8e/b1/8eb119a8d1fec73e23474c1af9c7d82e.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<h3>布置社交餐桌</h3><p>户外用餐能打造出休闲放松的用餐气氛。在餐桌中间放置餐具，让每个人自己取用盘子和杯子。用大公用碗盛食物，方便客人自己取用，然后几秒种后放回！</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "加热餐具。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/f2/39/f239ec783a63d5ae9cc4fb17ae368c6a.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/f2/39/f239ec783a63d5ae9cc4fb17ae368c6a.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<h3>让餐具不受天气影响</h3><p>事先用烤箱加热杯子和盘子，使用盖子使饮料保温更久。软木具备良好的隔热性，IKEA 365+ 软木杯垫还可以用作 IKEA 365+ 大杯的盖子。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "把毯子和羊皮盖在椅子上。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/96/68/9668c4ea0d0124f6d96c40b004673599.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/96/68/9668c4ea0d0124f6d96c40b004673599.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<h3>将自己和座位裹起来</h3><p>冬季烧烤派对的黄金法则是保证所有人都感到温暖。这意味着为聚会盛装打扮，把羊皮和休闲毯盖在椅子上，以便客人吃饭时可以裹在身上。灵活应对。Henrik说：“有时候我们在户外做饭吃饭。有时候天气太冷，我们会回到屋里的餐桌上吃饭。” </p>"
   ],
